{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:08 2026-05-07 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:08 2026-05-07 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:08 2026-05-07 HKT</p><img alt=\"傷者由救護車送院。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/9c3df3dc28929fbf97e89bd3c6bd1a26/2026-05/page_63.jpg\"/><p>今日（7日）中午12時許，九龍城警區刑事調查隊在土瓜灣木廠街1C號大廈，調查一宗發生於5月5日的爆竊案，其間一名40多歲男子疑見警員到場慌忙逃走，由窗口跳向對面大廈簷篷，未料跌落簷篷受傷。救援人員接報到場，將男子救下，送往伊利沙伯醫院搶救。據報傷者手腳受傷，獲送院時神智清醒。</p><img alt=\"男子由救護車送院。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/098e499b3dcef1efc7f3ad965ce14a0a/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4a3df7c59624e6d24fed400103104e37/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_03.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/1f97cc5b1fe5e94dba59734b85edfc6b/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_05.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/914940c5ed1e1809638e80e1a12af91f/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_06.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a46ed4f0e8fed48a73661d1f3c5608be/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_07.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/04abe6645301dac72c740dfa459ff5da/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_09.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/76bacb01eed07110cf1c8bb5b55e8c59/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_11.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/cad2f6c14393e30bf278ff9842a67f58/2026-05/KakaoTalk_20260507_132447059_12.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-07T06:25:53.316673+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":9,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}